# Every text file is checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says on the
# machine. Prettier's default endOfLine is lf, so a CRLF checkout fails
# `npm run format:check` locally while CI on Linux passes, and a red
# /preflight nobody trusts is worse than none.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
